{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Common.CyclotomicValueTruncates","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Common.CyclotomicValueTruncates","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.BigOperators.Group.Finset.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Ring.Defs"],"declarations":3,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Common.cyclotomic_value_truncates","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Common.cyclotomic_value_truncates","kind":"theorem","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Common/CyclotomicValueTruncates.lean#L49-L69","doc":"**Cyclotomic value truncates.** At a root of unity `ζ` with `(ζ;ζ)_N = 0`,\na cyclotomic sum `Σ_{m ≤ M} a_m (ζ;ζ)_m` (`M ≥ N`) equals its partial sum up\nto `N`: every term with `m ≥ N` vanishes.\n\nThis is the finite, unipotent-triangular change of basis between the Habiro\ncyclotomic coefficients `a_m` and the root-of-unity value — the algebraic\nfact that makes the residue ↔ cyclotomic-tail equivalence a **finite\nalgebraic identity**, not an analytic one. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Common.qPochDiag_eq_zero_of_ge","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Common.qPochDiag_eq_zero_of_ge","kind":"theorem","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Common/CyclotomicValueTruncates.lean#L40-L47","doc":"If `(u;u)_N = 0` then `(u;u)_m = 0` for every `m ≥ N`: the vanishing factor\nof the shorter product persists into the longer one. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Common.qPochDiag","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Common.qPochDiag","kind":"def","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Common/CyclotomicValueTruncates.lean#L36-L38","doc":"Diagonal q-Pochhammer `(u;u)_m = ∏_{k=1}^{m} (1 - u^k)`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}